          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8220;All Other Compensation&#8221; amount for Mr.&#160;Yates in 2025 consists of the following items: 401(k) matching contributions, $12,960; health, short-term and long-term disability, $21,107; and life insurance and AD&amp;D, $3,071. </span>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;">
